Objective

Design and build a production-ready Enterprise Quantum Exposure Assessment™ page that integrates seamlessly into the existing QGuard Helix platform.

This page is NOT intended to compete with SSL Labs or other TLS scanners. Instead, it serves as an executive-grade, public-facing assessment that analyzes only externally observable cryptographic evidence while introducing QGuard Helix's premium enterprise capabilities.

The scanner should establish technical credibility, provide valuable insights, and naturally guide organizations toward the authenticated Enterprise platform for deeper analysis.

The implementation must follow enterprise UX principles similar to CrowdStrike Falcon, Wiz, Microsoft Defender, Palo Alto Prisma Cloud, and Datadog.

