Final Goal

Deliver a polished, production-ready Enterprise Quantum Exposure Assessment™ experience that demonstrates QGuard Helix's expertise in cryptography and post-quantum security while remaining technically accurate about what can be inferred from Internet-facing evidence. The public scanner should provide meaningful executive insights, clear business recommendations, and visually compelling results, while naturally leading users toward authenticated Enterprise capabilities such as Cryptographic Governance Center™, Quantum Readiness Assessment Engine™, Cryptographic Bill of Materials (CBOM), Runtime Crypto Telemetry Engine™, Migration Sandbox™, and Sophia AI Security Copilot™. Every UI component, workflow, and recommendation should reinforce QGuard Helix as an enterprise platform for cryptographic governance and post-quantum migration—not merely a TLS scanner.